# Judge10-20-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureAlisa.0-4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:おめえらだって<br>わかってんだろうがよ……。|#0205Trial20_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureAlisa.0-4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"ウチらは魔女だ。<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_20_01\">呪われた子</link>だ。|#0205Trial20_Alisa002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureAlisa.0-4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"誰かを<link=\"Objection_02_05_20_02\">殺すための力</link>を<br>持って生まれてきて、<br>実際に誰かを<br>殺すことでしか<br>生きていけねー存在<br>なんだよ。|#0205Trial20_Alisa003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureAlisa.0-1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そんなん、<br>今取り戻した記憶を見りゃ<br>わかるだろ！？|#0205Trial20_Alisa004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureAlisa.2-4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……ならそんなもんは<br>存在しちゃいけねーんだ。|#0205Trial20_Alisa005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureAlisa.2-4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"みんな跡形もなく<br>消し炭にして……<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_20_03\">終わらせちまえばいい</link>。|#0205Trial20_Alisa006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureAlisa.2-4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ウチなら、<br>それができる……。|#0205Trial20_Alisa007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureAlisa.1-8
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:4
@PrintDebateText Text:"だから……<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_20_04\">大人しく</link>死んどけよぉ！|#0205Trial20_Alisa008|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4


